.TH ITCMDR\-RESTORE 1 "" "itcmdr" "itcmdr manual"
.SH NAME
itcmdr\-restore \- restore helper started by the server for an app or CLI restore
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
itcmdr\-restore (started by itcmdr\-server; not run by hand)
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Stops the service, restores the staged archive into the data directory, restarts and health-checks the server, and rolls back on failure. Use \fBitcmdr-cli restore-stage\fR to start it.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBitcmdr\fR(7), docs/README.md (also the in-app help: \fBitcmdr-cli help\fR, \fBitcmdr-admin help\fR)
